{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-08", "pageid": 101321, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-07\" title=\"末日与末日之后-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.AB.E6.97.A5.E4.B9.8B.E5.90.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"末日之后\">末日之后</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 末日之后</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Days After</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马戏团成员：</div><div>请进，尊贵的客人们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马戏团成员：</div><div>我保证今天的演出不会令你们失望！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跟随着入场的人群，库珀花环迈动双腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到最后一刻，她都没有弄清胸腔中的轰鸣究竟源于畏惧还是期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但疑问最终随着演出的开场烟消云散。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_dingpeng\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_dingpeng\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马戏团成员：</div><div>下面有请我们的空中飞人——塔莉娅！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_maxituanyanchu\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_maxituanyanchu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_maxituanyanchu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在浪涛般的欢呼中，身姿窈窕的少女踩上钢索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-634401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尤利娅：</div><div>哇哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安东：</div><div>她走得真稳！就像是……像是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>——就像是走在空中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环仰头注视着半空中的那个身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是个她从未见过的女孩，台前幕后的所有马戏团成员也都是她未曾谋面的人物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这里的并不是她的乌特恩亚亚。<br />心中存有的一丝希冀也成了泡影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但奇妙的是——她的心脏仍然在安稳地、有力地跳动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>她很厉害，不比我差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>演出令人目不暇接，人们的脸上洋溢着笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都如此熟悉。<br />这正是她所怀念的、她无比害怕失去却又最终不得不作别的乌特恩亚亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我差点忘记了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>看别人在钢索上行走，是这样的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_beiduidiqiu\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_beiduidiqiu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_beiduidiqiu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像对方代替自己飞上高空、飞向宇宙，飞至遥远的天边。<br />她的目光于是也望向了更远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那遮蔽天空的帐幕曾为她圈出一方小天地，狭小但温暖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但此时它再也罩不住她了。<br />它被风雪掀开，露出背后真实的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是库珀花环曾一度亲眼目睹的光景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>原来……是这样。<br />现在我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有遥望宇宙时，人们才能够领悟自身的渺小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而同样的，只有回首过去再远眺未来，置身于这条看不见的时间长河中时，人们才能知道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>此时此刻是这样独一无二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>彼时的决意复苏在胸中，此刻却更加坚定与确凿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去赋予她前行的勇气，未来尚存值得期许的希望——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因此没有理由停滞不前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_dingpeng\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_dingpeng\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_dingpeng.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马戏团成员：</div><div>感谢各位的大驾光临，今天的演出——圆满落幕了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_maxituan\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_maxituan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_maxituan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>说来惭愧，这还是我第一次看马戏团演出，它远比我想象中的更精彩、也更让人快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>多谢你带我们来了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坐在身旁的妇人转过头来，但她说到一半的话语却顿住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，她露出了一个了然的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>你要走了吗，孩子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浪涛般的欢呼声仍未止歇，但库珀花环已从坐席站起了身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摸上口袋中最后一张传送软盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>拉瑞莎女士，还有安东小先生、尤利娅小小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我想，我得走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前往她犹未可知的未来。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlundating1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlundating1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偌大的会场中宾客如云。<br />有人着正装，但也有不少人穿着似乎略不合时宜的制服或研究服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被人群包围着的研究员就是其中之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>指针女士，我们都对您所在小队完成的研究非常感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>不知我们是否有幸见见其他的成员？<br />比如冷周六小姐，以及那位年轻的宇航员小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>当然，我很愿意为您引荐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>不过路德维希先生联系我说，您那边的分部希望和普列谢茨克在卢恩矿石的流通与利用上进行一些合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>也许我们可以先就这个话题聊一聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>望着不远处担下绝大多数社交工作的同僚，某位蛇发女妖将最后一匙甜品送入口中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>果然舒芙蕾还得吃刚刚出炉的，基金会的厨师有一手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>我更喜欢那边的那道小羊排，快帮我再拿一盘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那个吃过了，我更想试试那道鞑靼牛肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第三者的加入及时中断了一场手足间的无谓争执。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您好，冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>登记完成了？一切顺利？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走在青年身侧的少女微笑着点了点头作为回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>看来只剩下一个人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>库珀花环小姐还没露面？她不是会迟到的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>也许是她对这种场合没兴趣，不打算来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我没意见，今天也没人记考勤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她语气轻巧，对面的棕发青年却蹙起了眉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>又也许，是我们操之过急了。<br />我们不该让她一个人——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他话未说完，便看到一旁的远旅忽然亮起眼睛，迎向了会场入口的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想起自己被嘱托的职责，青年也连忙跟上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>——阿涅娅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>远旅，你在这里！<br />这里的人好多，我还担心找不到你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>还有命名日先生，您好。<br />不好意思，我来晚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>没什么好道歉的，只是以库珀花环小姐而言，这倒是有些罕见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>是什么事情耽搁了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>拉瑞莎女士听说我要来参加一场宴会，便说要帮我打扮一番。<br />只是试了几套衣服，我都觉得有些别扭……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>最后还是穿了平常的这一套，所以才有些迟了。<br />但拉瑞莎女士还是替我整理了发辫……看起来怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>阿涅娅，漂亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>看起来这几天你遇到了不错的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环的笑容让一旁的青年打消了疑虑，少女的友人也扬起了嘴角，哼唱出了愉快的旋律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一束洁白的花朵被递到库珀花环的面前，清雅的花香吻上少女的鼻尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是……给我的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种奇妙的默契让库珀花环很快理解了好友想要表达的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>你说这是你在沿途发现的花朵……它真漂亮。谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>很高兴听到你也经历了一次精彩的旅途。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>收起那不知名的花束，库珀花环向大厅中望了望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>在找你的老师和冷周六她们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我刚刚还看到了北方哨歌女士。她还和我说想要把阿夫西维、尼娜和彼得森他们几个小同学介绍给你认识……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但青年同样没能找到那袭棕色的大衣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不过露西女士将她叫去了，也许你得稍等一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>至于冷周六女士嘛，她在那里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循着命名日示意的方向望去，库珀花环很快发现了研究员的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方分明看到了她，却在投来一个眼神后向会场外走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个邀请。库珀花环快步跟了上去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们沿走廊一路向前，直到四周无人，喧嚣声也只隐约可闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这里的空气清新多了，就是有点冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但同样是冬天，“暴雨”过后感觉比之前暖和些……不知道是不是错觉，等我回去翻翻数据好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我没想到您说的庆功宴规模这样大，也许我还是应该穿得更正式一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>倒也不必在意，毕竟这场宴会其实也不全是为了我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>再前一次“暴雨”后，拉普拉斯乱成了一锅粥，还是靠那位露西女士才好不容易回到了正轨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>基金会这边的情况也好不到哪里去。<br />现在“暴雨”又至，大家都需要一个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这样他们才能松一口气、才能笑出来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>才能相信即使“暴雨”再次蛮不讲理地降临，我们也总有一天会撕开它那故作神秘的面纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您是说……我们带来了那个好消息。<br />而这是一场为所有人举办的宴会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>咱们只是大家撒欢的借口。<br />真是不知感恩，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我们的所作所为竟然还有这样的作用……这对我来说也是个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……你看着和之前有些不一样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六看着面前的少女，弯起了嘴角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我还拿到了一个消息。<br />现在还在保密阶段，但想来过段时间基金会就会公布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你一定会想知道的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她凑近库珀花环，压低了嗓音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——他们发现了能够在“暴雨”中行走的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环的大脑空白了片刻。她花了一会儿工夫去理解其中的含义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您的意思是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>听说是第一防线学校的学生，她将被任命为“司辰”，负责解决“暴雨”相关的麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>基金会可能不会同意把人借给我们，但我想我们可以搞到那位“司辰”得到的数据，所以——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>没错，我们有了一个杀手锏。<br />距离破解那该死的“暴雨”之谜，我们又向前走了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六的竖瞳因兴奋而微微颤抖着，而库珀花环的心中也泛起波澜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这真是一个好消息……一个很好的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她本已经做好心理准备，也许此前和今后很长一段时间的努力都不会立竿见影地得到什么收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但看来是她太过悲观了。<br />在她决心前行的道路上，已有希望之火被点亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……嗯？<br />你怀里的那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原来是方才自远旅处获得的不知名花束探出了头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这是远旅刚才送给我的。<br />我想我见过这种花，但一时想不起来它的名字了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>它怎么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六面带哑然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这是丁香花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可它是春天开的花。奇怪，为什么现在就——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然失笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我真是过糊涂了，忙起来就忘了月份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环也笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是呀，冷周六女士。您瞧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>现在已经是春天了。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-08"}}